{"id": "66199", "title": "军魅（军旅）", "author": "十月芹溪", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 15, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66199.htm", "intro": "严佑西甩掉身上最后一件衣服，问：“我干你？还是你干我？”\r\n连浩天撕开禁欲的军装，狠狠道：“女人再强势也只是女人！在床上，你得听我的！”\r\n会功夫的小妖女反扑闷骚的B海舰队驱逐编队大队长连浩天，天雷勾地火！\r\n“犯我境者，三光正法! 乱我心者，脱光正法！”\r\n\r\n连浩天弟弟连浩东的文\r\n“敌寇捣蛋，战场解决。媳妇捣蛋，床上解决。”\r\n\r\n内容标签：军旅 婚恋 高干 制服情缘", "base": "files/article/html/66/66199", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9950950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9950951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9950952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9950953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9950954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9950955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9950956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9950957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9950958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "9950959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "9950960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "9950961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "9950962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "9950963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9950964.html", "available": false}]}